    "long_instructions": "# Plant Doctor: use the model\nYour model learned from 54 plants. Now let it decide.\n\n1. Take your rule out of **when Help Me! clicked**. Put in **predict**, and show **This plant is** and the prediction.\n2. Test the same six plants. Compare the model's answers with your rule's answers.\n3. **Combine them.** Some problems are best solved with a rule first. For example: if the soil is dry, show **Water me first!** Otherwise, ask the model.\n\nWhich way worked best: your rules, the model, or both together? Why?",
    "guide_steps": [
      {
        "text": "**Data.** Replace your rule with **predict**, and show the prediction. Compare the model with your rule on the same six plants. Then **combine** them: a rule first, the model in the **else**. Which way works best, and why?",
        "showContinue": true
      }
    ],
